/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (After learning the prerequisites, you can already get started with important DevOps skills of working with containers and container orchestration tools. So basically learning Docker and Kubernetes to help your teams deploy and efficiently run the application.)
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
707 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (And since most of the modern applications and Kubernetes clusters are running on cloud, you need to learn cloud infrastructure, how to work with cloud infrastructure, how to configure it, how to scale it and so on.)
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
708 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (As a DevOps professional automation skills are one of the most important ones. And as the heart of DevOps, learning to build CI/CD pipelines is an essential skill.)
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [11 12]
>>
endobj
709 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Finally you will learn how to automate parts of the complete DevOps processes one by one using the concepts and tools of what's called X as code: IaC, Configuration as Code, Security as Code, Policy as Code and so on, which basically means just automating everything in the form of code!)
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [13]
>>
